  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assessing the respect for IHL in conflict-affected parts of the Philippines</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to contribute to the enhanced protection of conflict-affected communities by coming up with comprehensive study that will inform the development of contextualized strategies to advocate for improved respect for International humanitarian law (IHL) and civilian protection.</narrative>
  </description>
